window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When a two-thousand-year-old jewel of Cleopatra’s is discovered in a Brooklyn construction zone, Annja, Roux, and Garin team up to hunt for the missing tomb of Cleopatra. <br> <br> From the sand dunes of The Sudan, to the misty avenues of London, and the ruins of ancient Alexandria beneath the Mediterranean Sea, Annja uncovers Egyptian mysteries. The great pyramids on the River Nile have secret chambers, mummies, and tombs full of endless gold. <br> <br> Will Annja discover the tomb of Cleopatra, the last Pharaoh of Egypt? Or will the Queen’s sarcophagus elude Annja like countless treasure hunters for centuries?<br> <br> Produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!<br> <br> Performed by Nanette Savard, Colleen Delany, Terence Aselford, Richard Rohan, Jenna Sharpe, Danny Gavigan, Nicole Perez, Neha Gargava, Nora Achrati, Nazia Chaudhry, Elias Khalil, Peter Holdway, Joey Sourlis, Zeke Alton, Lucy Symons, Robb Moreira, James Konicek, James Lewis, K’lai Rivera, Shanta Parasuraman, Nathaniel Priestly, Jeri Marshall, Michael Glenn, Bradley Foster Smith, Ken Jackson and Michael John Casey.</p>"; 
